    icon: '🃏',
  },
  data: {
    LLM: '1. **Start**: Player with most 3s leads (or 4s, 5s...). 2. **Play**: Play 1+ cards of same rank ≥ pile top. Restrictions: pictures only on >6; Aces only on pictures or Aces; 2s on anything except Ace/10; 10s and Aces clear. 3. **Pick up**: Cannot play → take whole pile. 4. **Draw**: If stock not empty, may draw and try to play; if illegal, take drawn card + pile. 5. **Replenish**: After playing, draw to 5 until stock empty. 6. **Clear**: 10 on lower, Ace on picture, or four-of-a-kind on top clears pile; same player plays again.',
    Player: '1. **Start**: Player with most 3s leads (or 4s, 5s...). 2. **Play**: Play 1+ cards of same rank ≥ pile top. Restrictions: pictures only on >6; Aces only on pictures or Aces; 2s on anything except Ace/10; 10s and Aces clear. 3. **Pick up**: Cannot play → take whole pile. 4. **Draw**: If stock not empty, may draw and try to play; if illegal, take drawn card + pile. 5. **Replenish**: After playing, draw to 5 until stock empty. 6. **Clear**: 10 on lower, Ace on picture, or four-of-a-kind on top clears pile; same player plays again.',
    objective: 'Get rid of all your cards. Last player holding cards is paskahousu (loser).',
    gameplay: '1. **Start**: Player with most 3s leads (or 4s, 5s...). 2. **Play**: Play 1+ cards of same rank ≥ pile top. Restrictions: pictures only on >6; Aces only on pictures or Aces; 2s on anything except Ace/10; 10s and Aces clear. 3. **Pick up**: Cannot play → take whole pile. 4. **Draw**: If stock not empty, may draw and try to play; if illegal, take drawn card + pile. 5. **Replenish**: After playing, draw to 5 until stock empty. 6. **Clear**: 10 on lower, Ace on picture, or four-of-a-kind on top clears pile; same player plays again.',
    keyRules: [
      '2: Play on any except Ace/10; nothing plays on 2 except 2.',
      '10: On lower card clears pile; on empty table stays (only 10s on 10).',
      'Ace: On picture clears pile; on empty stays (only Aces on Ace).',
      'Four of a kind on top clears pile.',
      'Pictures only if top >6; Aces only on picture or Ace.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
    useTrump: false,
