      'Rule example: Get rid of all your cards. Last player holding cards is paskahousu (loser).',
      'Turn-flow example: 1. **Start**: Player with most 3s leads (or 4s, 5s...). 2. **Play**: Play 1+ cards of same rank ≥ pile top. Restrictions: pictures only on >6; Aces only on pictures or Aces; 2s on anything except Ace/10; 10s and Aces clear. 3. **Pick up**: Cannot play → take whole pile. 4. **Draw**: If stock not empty, may draw and try to play; if illegal, take drawn card + pile. 5. **Replenish**: After playing, draw to 5 until stock empty. 6. **Clear**: 10 on lower, Ace on picture, or four-of-a-kind on top clears pile; same player plays again.',
